# Reach (CR 702.17): Skewer Slinger blocks Bot2's attacking Ornithopter (0/2, flying), which only a flying or reach creature
# can block. Its block trigger deals 1 damage and combat damage 1 more, so the Ornithopter dies and the Slinger takes none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Skewer Slinger
Mountain x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Skewer Slinger.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Skewer Slinger > Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Skewer Slinger.Damage = 0
